Package: fmstick
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: qt6-qpa-plugins
Description: control application for USB FM/RDS transmitters (Si4711)
 Sets the frequency, power, audio processing and RDS (station name,
 RadioText, clock time) of USB FM transmitters built on a Si4711 chip:
 the FmStick and the Vast HiFi-FMT.
 .
 Simple main screen, advanced settings, RadioText from the track a media
 player is playing (MPRIS), and a web page to control the transmitter
 from a phone. English, French, Russian and Ukrainian.
